{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"﻿\n﻿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3HGTSG8SDK36HXAV7CKAP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏も明けてすっかり秋\n今年の夏は特に早く感じました　　、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"　　\n例えるならW-KEYAKI FES\n『タイムマシーンでyeah ! 』の約4分間で\nコニファーの会場を一周した\nトロッコ(タイムマシーン)並みに速かったな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3HHWKMK9ZJDZGV0N0X45G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１期生が集合するスピードも負けてないです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハーサルのとき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3HJZDMNNND0AF9TPH6297","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハブのイラストを\nスタッフさんが描いてくださったのですが\n可愛すぎて飲み切ってしまうのが\n勿体無いなと思ってしまって喉越し悪かった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日はバージョンアップしてて\nもっと喉越し悪くなりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3HKYD4AWABXX20QZJX0K6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていうのは冗談で\n水分は毎日しっかり摂るようにしています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう話に大園玲は笑ってくれるの😘❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3HN0YJNN90JW2K1C8KKH1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ\n櫻坂４６、２nd TOUR ２０２２始まるで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪公演スタートです\n是非たくさん関西弁使わせてください\n会場に来てくださる皆さんお待ちしてます！"}],"source":"archive"}